# Colly invariants (do not violate without explicit instruction)

## Stack
- Next.js 16 App Router, `cacheComponents: true`, Prisma 6, Supabase Auth/Storage.
- Forbidden: `export const dynamic = "force-dynamic"`. Layouts use `await connection()` and `export const instant = false`.
- Error boundaries use `retry()`, not `reset()`. Hero images use `preload`, not `priority`.
- Splash screen is scoped to the dashboard only — never let overlays or celebrations render above the LCP element.

## Tenancy & auth
- Every Prisma model except `Business` is scoped by `businessId` with `onDelete: Cascade`.
- `businessId` always comes from the session, never from a request body.
- Supabase Auth is the only credential store. `User.password` is a legacy NOT NULL column holding `""`.
- `requireAuth()` / `requireOwner()` / `requireOwnerApi()` guard pages and APIs.
- The proxy excludes `/api`, so **every owner-only mutation must call `requireOwnerApi()`**.
- Staff (`TeamMember`, role `STAFF`) must never see owner-only settings. Preserve the `?denied=staff_restricted` flow.

## AI brain (treat as read-only unless told otherwise)
- `lib/chat-engine.ts` is the single reply pipeline. Do not modify it for UI work.
- `HISTORY_LIMIT = 10`, `MAX_TOOL_ROUNDS = 2`.
- `TONES = ["formal", "friendly"]`. Pidgin is detected by `lib/language-detect.ts` — there is no `pidgin_friendly` tone. Do not add one.
- Credits are reserved before any model call; refunds on fallback/`[SILENCE]`/failed insert. Do not reorder.

## Money
- `lib/plans.ts` is the single source of truth. Prices: Free 80 credits/30d; Green ₦15k/23k; Blue ₦25k/41k; Black ₦50k/90k; yearly = 10 months.
- 1 credit = ₦1. AI reply = 5 credits (standard), 80 (WhatsApp), 0 (manual). Top-up 3,000 = ₦3,000.
- Split wallet: `planCredits` is overwritten on plan charge, `topUpCredits` never resets. All money on invoice paths is integer kobo (`nairaToKobo`/`koboToNaira`).
- VAT 7.5% on manual/sale invoices, 0 on receipt drafts.

## SEO / routes
- `lib/site.ts` (`PUBLIC_PAGES`, `PRIVATE_PATHS`), `lib/seo.ts`, `lib/public-routes.ts` are the single sources of truth.
- Sitemap priorities are non-increasing and asserted by `tests/seo.test.ts`.
- Dashboard, agent area, auth screens, web chat, `/chat/success` are `noindex`.

## Removed
- The Jiji feature is fully removed. Never reintroduce Jiji imports, routes, fields, copy, tests, or lessons.

## Verification
- Before reporting done: `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm test`.
- Tests run with `tsx --test`, 13 suites under `tests/`.
